---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '중국 도시 가이드 — 여행 목적지';
const description = '중국 여행에 맞는 도시를 찾아보세요.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="ko">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">🏙️ 도시</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 leading-tight">중국 도시 가이드</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">중국 여행에 맞는 도시를 찾아보세요.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-purple-800">6</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">도시 가이드</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-red-800">1</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">일정 플래너</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-blue-800">3</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">커버 지역</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-16 not-prose">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-purple-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-purple-800">여행 계획</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-purple-800 opacity-60">1개 글</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/cities/city-select/" class="block bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-800">🧭 계획</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국 여행, 며칠이 필요할까?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">완벽한 일정 계획 — 3일 강행군부터 3주 대모험까지.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-800">역사 & 문화</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-red-800 opacity-60">1개 글</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/cities/beijing-guide/" class="block bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">🏛️ 베이징</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">베이징 여행 가이드: 볼거리, 먹거리 & 필수 정보</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">자금성, 만리장성, 후퉁, 베이징 덕, 필수 팁.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-800">현대 & 도시</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-800 opacity-60">2개 글</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/cities/shanghai-guide/" class="block bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">🌆 상하이</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">상하이 여행 가이드: 외국인에게 가장 친화적인 도시</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">와이탄, 상하이 타워, 프랑스 조계지, 세계적 수준의 식도락.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/cities/shenzhen-guide/" class="block bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">🏙️ 선전</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">선전 여행 가이드: 홍콩 옆의 테크 허브</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">중국의 실리콘밸리, 해안 자전거, 홍콩까지 15분 기차.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-800">자연 & 경관</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-emerald-800 opacity-60">1개 글</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/cities/hainan-visa-free/" class="block bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">🏝️ 하이난</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">하이난 여행 가이드 — 30일 무비자</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">열대 해변, 열대우림, 59개국 무비자 입국.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-orange-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-orange-800">음식 & 라이프스타일</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-orange-800 opacity-60">2개 글</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/cities/guangzhou-guide/" class="block bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-800">🥟 광저우</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">광저우 여행 가이드: 중국의 미식 수도</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">딤섬, 캔턴 타워, 사몐 섬, 중국 남부의 관문.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/cities/chengdu-guide/" class="block bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-orange-800">🐼 청두</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">청두 여행 가이드: 판다, 매운 음식 & 느린 삶</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">자이언트 판다, 쓰촨 훠궈, 찻집, 주자이거우 관문.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5">관련 가이드</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <a href="/ko/transport/high-speed-rail/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">고속철도</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">도시 간 이동</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/ko/transport/metro-bus/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">지하철 & 버스</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">도심 이동</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>